Lead Enterprise UX Designer &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i.imgur.com/XN94Hg4.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;900&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are hiring a Lead Enterprise UX Designer to help lead UX across Terra Quantum’s enterprise software portfolio. This is a senior, hands-on role reporting directly to the Head of UX. You will lead major initiatives, mentor other designers, and help maintain our design system and UX standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your initial work will focus on enterprise security products that identify cryptographic risk and help security teams prioritize remediation. Later work will include optimization software for warehouse operations and customer-facing machine-learning solutions for areas such as predictive maintenance and production forecasting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role requires strong qualitative research, systems thinking, information architecture, and interaction design. You will participate in Product-led ideation and event storming sessions, conduct user interviews, contribute to surveys, and work closely with Engineering on integration, permissions, data, and implementation constraints.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Some projects require polished interfaces for demonstrations and executive communication. Production solutions often need to fit into systems customers already use. The design problems therefore extend beyond screens to how complex technical capabilities fit into real enterprise workflows. You will help determine when a new interface adds value and when an integration, embedded workflow, or administrative surface is the better solution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of professional experience in UX, interaction design, product design, or a closely related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Portfolio evidence showing research, information architecture, interaction design, and the reasoning behind major design decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience conducting qualitative user research, including interviews and usability studies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing complex enterprise, industrial, scientific, security, or other data-intensive software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience translating research findings into workflows, information architecture, interaction models, prototypes, or product recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working directly with Product and Engineering throughout discovery, design, and implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mentoring designers or leading design critique.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with enterprise security, identity, access control, or data governance products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ERP, warehouse-management, logistics, or other operational enterprise systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing products that integrate into existing customer platforms rather than operate only as standalone applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with optimization, machine learning, analytics, or decision-support software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience maintaining or contributing to a design system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with accessibility standards and inclusive design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in distributed or research-driven technical organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overall&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead UX research and design for complex enterprise software initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate research into information architecture, workflows, interaction models, prototypes, and design recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in Product-led discovery, ideation, and event storming activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Engineering on data, permissions, integrations, and implementation constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Determine when a capability needs a new interface and when an embedded workflow or integration better fits the customer environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor designers and contribute to design critique, standards, and design-system stewardship.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review implementation to ensure delivered experiences match the intended design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Day-to-day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct customer and user interviews, usability studies, and workflow analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Synthesize research into design decisions, prototypes, and specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join Product-led discovery, ideation, and event-storming sessions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review workflows, permissions, data requirements, and integration constraints with Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and review interaction designs and production-ready interface designs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in design critique and maintain consistency with the company design system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review implemented work with engineers and resolve design issues during delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The Rewards&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We are an international team of quantum technology experts and dedicated business creatives that are working to bring quantum-enabled solutions to the global market. Our brilliant team members enjoy a high degree of freedom working remotely or joining one of our office spaces. We have a vibrant, enthusiastic, passionate and creative culture driven by trust, excellence and continuous improvement. If you join the Terra Quantum team, you &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;can expect:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;21&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;An opportunity to work with some of the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;brightest minds in the pioneering field of Quantum Technologies as well as an experienced and progressive Leadership team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;21&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Gain knowledge of some of the most cutting-edge technology developments in science &amp;amp; engineering&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;21&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;2&quot;&gt;A chance to be part of one of Europe’s leading technology firms of the upcoming decades&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;21&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Welcoming, friendly, and professional colleagues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;21&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;2&quot;&gt;A personal development plan with clear goals for advancement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;21&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;2&quot;&gt;A competitive salary&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;21&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Flexible working arrangements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;21&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;2&quot;&gt;A diverse and supportive atmosphere, where innovation and initiative are encouraged&amp;nbsp;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;If you are enthusiastic about positively impacting the world and helping to drive the second quantum revolution, let’s talk!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Company description&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Quantum technologies have the potential to solve some of the world’s biggest challenges. There have been great advances in all areas of quantum technologies, and new fields of application are opened up every day. Hybrid computer systems that combine classic high-performance computing with quantum computers are already being used to develop solutions in sectors such as logistics, healthcare, finance, energy, automotive and aerospace. Quantum mechanical predictions are also used to obtain unprecedented precision in measurements, generate unbreakable codes, and form the basis of impenetrable communication networks. All these developments are happening right now, and they are happening at Terra Quantum.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;At Terra Quantum we are building the world’s leading Quantum Technology company. We offer customers world-class quantum technology expertise organized as “quantum-as-a-service”: hybrid quantum algorithms, quantum compute and quantum enabled security solutions. Through the proprietary quantum cloud, customers have access to a unique technology platform which provides a toolset to solve real-world challenges in the realms of machine learning, optimization and simulation, today. In 2022, the company closed its Series A financing round with a $75m fundraise.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Quantum physics has, in some respects, parallels to the machine language of our computers-the zeros and ones into which our keyboard or touchscreen instructions are translated for execution in the computer-only on a larger scale: it is the machine language of the universe. The second quantum revolution is based on the control of individual quantum systems, such as individual atoms. We use quantum computers to solve currently unsolvable problems, simulate molecules and their interactions, find drugs for diseases that are not yet curable, find new materials, or make artificial intelligence stronger. Quantum is now.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Terra Quantum is a future-focused quantum services and technology company working on making the second quantum revolution a reality. Terra Quantum’s activities span all areas, markets, and industries globally.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our purpose is to pioneer quantum technologies to change the world for good,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our vision is to lead the quantum revolution and be the trailblazer in technology solutions, shaping a better future for humankind to thrive in, and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our mission is to unleash the power of quantum tech to deliver meaningful solutions today&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Terra Quantum is an equal opportunities employer, committed to diversity, inclusion and employee well-being.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Product

Staff Product Manager &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help make the world more hospitable &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The hospitality industry is uniquely human, and it deserves technology that’s just as inspiring as the people behind it. At Mews, we’re transforming the industry with a platform that helps hotels run smarter, move faster and create better guest experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work with smart, curious people who care deeply about what they do. You’ll have autonomy and the trust to make good decisions and move quickly. And you’ll enjoy a real sense of purpose as you see the impact of what we’re building.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re motivated by ownership, curiosity and meaningful impact, and are driven to deliver consistent high performance, you’ll feel at home here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Let&#39;s get into the specifics. It’s impossible to capture every nuance of a role – especially at a rapidly growing company like Mews – but if we had to distil it into a job description (which we do because this is a job description), it would be this:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;_3iDTPbvLZJ renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-level=&quot;3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;Help-make-the-world-more-hospitable&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;295&quot;&gt;Help make the world more hospitable&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;332&quot;&gt;The hospitality industry is uniquely human, and it deserves technology that&#39;s just as inspiring as the people behind it. At Mews, we&#39;re transforming the industry with a platform that helps hotels run smarter, move faster and create better guest experiences. You&#39;ll work with smart, curious people who care deeply about what they do. You&#39;ll have autonomy and the trust to make good decisions and move quickly. And you&#39;ll enjoy a real sense of purpose as you see the impact of what we&#39;re building. If you&#39;re motivated by ownership, curiosity and meaningful impact, and are driven to deliver consistent high performance, you&#39;ll feel at home here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;_3iDTPbvLZJ renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-level=&quot;3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;About-the-role&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;977&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;993&quot;&gt;Let&#39;s get into the specifics. It&#39;s impossible to capture every nuance of a role – especially at a rapidly growing company like Mews – but if we had to distil it into a job description (which we do because this is a job description), it would be this:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1245&quot;&gt;The Guest Revenue tribe owns the products that help hotels earn more from every guest interaction: our booking engine, upselling tools, ancillary revenue features, and the guest recognition layer that makes personalization possible. You&#39;ll sit directly alongside Diana Arizmendi (Director of Product and Engineering) as her right hand on the tribe&#39;s hardest product problems: improving upsell attach rates (currently ~2%), scaling guest recognition, and shipping the Reputation Manager into GA. You won&#39;t be running discovery yourself for every feature — instead, you&#39;ll own the tribe&#39;s product context and encode your product judgment into the agents, evals, and shared systems that the Product Builders draw on autonomously. When the system doesn&#39;t produce the right output, you fix it at the root. When the tribe faces a genuinely ambiguous strategic bet, you own the answer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;_3iDTPbvLZJ renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-level=&quot;3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;What-you-would-do&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2242&quot;&gt;What you would do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the product context your team builds from: the customer evidence, outcome definitions, prioritisation logic and decision history that makes every build decision faster and more grounded.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Encode your product thinking into shared tools and systems so that good problem framing and rigorous discovery happen by default, not through constant oversight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead discovery on the team&#39;s hardest open questions, from improving how guests discover and accept offers to building the data layer that makes guest recognition reliable at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with the Director of Product and Engineering on complex strategic calls, cross functional alignment and the decisions that have the most long term leverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Staff Engineers and Staff Designers to make sure product decisions hold up technically and create experiences guests actually notice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5562&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;AI Fluency Level 3:&lt;/strong&gt; in this role, that means you design the agents and shared workflows your product builders use to turn customer evidence into decisions, not just use AI tools yourself. You build an approach to discovery and context management that others on the team can pick up and run with on their own, and you are the one who checks whether an AI generated recommendation actually holds up before it shapes a commercial decision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6000&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;For more information on AI fluency at Mews, please refer to &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;_2hGPVj98eZ _2i3C1kYbGa _2kH23qT6kp _1ubuxonXvL _34b3D2vc3e _1NDpvb6wH8 _2wtOC9vc3e _3e11vU6wH8 _0hSAgbHZdu _00uqCY98eZ _3xtjKN0Rl6 _0H9qDF6wH8 _24h04i2Njc _1mT5xdRAKS _0bjKvDcjp5 _0WKd3G4z3T _23rrnHo10F _1UtDYzM7Tp _32C2rk98eZ _0i9AWA0Rl6 _0mm6KQ6wH8 _10n1R5M7Tp _0DCa9DjOvk _3932vv0Rl6 _02cRtH6wH8 _1B4rbIo10F _0clgaMM7Tp _3WzCGijOvk _0NqVRt0Rl6 _3BKYwu6wH8 _3sFUREDdj4 _0CMRbkAwSC _2nTuUYWfPD _3ADzdEWfPD _1warJ9WfPD _4scvAwWyeI&quot; href=&quot;https://mews.atlassian.net/wiki/x/XQOskg&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;AI Fluency at Mews: A Comprehensive Guide for Candidates&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt; on Confluence.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;_3iDTPbvLZJ renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-level=&quot;3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;What-you-would-bring&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3331&quot;&gt;What you would bring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6179&quot;&gt;Staff or Principal level product experience: you have led the strategy for a meaningful product surface in B2B SaaS, and you set direction rather than execute it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6345&quot;&gt;A commercial mindset: you naturally reason in outcomes, revenue and business impact, and you can speak to how your product decisions moved a metric that mattered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6511&quot;&gt;AI Fluency Level 3 or the equivalent hands on experience: you have redesigned how a team works using AI, built an approach others followed, and you actively check AI output rather than taking it at face value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6724&quot;&gt;Technical fluency: you hold your own in engineering conversations, understand trade offs at the architecture level, and can translate technical constraints into product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6907&quot;&gt;Experience building reusable product systems: you have encoded your thinking into frameworks, agents or tooling that others actually use, not just documentation that lives in a wiki.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Czechia&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;1 491 000 Kč&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;2 519 000 Kč CZK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;UK&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£81,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£107,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Sweden&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;849 000 kr&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;1 333 000 kr SEK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Ireland&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€91.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€125.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency at Mews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary ranges are provided in good faith and reflect current market conditions and internal pay structures. Final compensation may be adjusted based on funding, budget constraints, or exceptional candidate qualifications, but will remain within reasonable proximity to the stated range.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This salary disclosure is provided in compliance with applicable pay transparency legislation. We are committed to equal pay practices and prohibit salary history inquiries during our recruitment process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If the location you&#39;re applying from wasn&#39;t originally advertised for this role, salary range information is available upon request at any point during the application/interview process - your recruiter will be able to help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our success is powered by our incredible people, supported by benefits that help them thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No matter where you’re based, you’ll enjoy:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited paid holiday (yes, really)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participation in our company share program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave (6 months fully paid for primary caregivers, 2 months for secondary, available after one year of service)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual Learning budget of €300 (and more for high performers) to support your development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly &quot;EDGE&quot; time to Explore, Develop, Grow, and Elevate yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A work from anywhere policy with flexibility to work abroad for a few weeks each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation options, available after one year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible, hybrid working options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A home office setup budget to make your workspace your own and a monthly work-from-home allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Claude tokens, so you can automate workflows and build smarter, more efficient ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Local benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll receive additional benefits that vary by location, from healthcare and retirement plans to team events, socials and other perks. Ask us about it during your interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Mews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunities employer. We value teams that reflect the diversity of the customers and communities we serve. Different perspectives make better ideas, stronger products and a more welcoming company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also believe transparency is important when deciding if you&#39;re the right fit. Mews is an ambitious, high-pressure environment of continuous learning and high standards. Success here requires resilience, adaptability and a willingness to solve difficult problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A few things that define how we work:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High autonomy means high responsibility. People are expected to take ownership and drive outcomes. There isn’t a detailed playbook for everything, and that’s part of what makes the work challenging – and rewarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change is constant. We’re growing quickly and adapting as we scale. Teams, processes and priorities continue to evolve, and only people who stay curious and agile will thrive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re remote-first, not relationship-free. Flexibility is core to how we work, but strong relationships still matter. Our teams are global, so we need expert collaborators and communicators to help us move forward together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI is an integral part of our processes. It’s not here to steal people’s jobs, but to amplify efficiency and productivity. We’re motivated to proactively use the technology to seek out better ways of working and share our findings with the rest of the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If there&#39;s anything we can do to support you during the application process, let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don&#39;t discriminate on the basis of race, religion, colour, nationality, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, disability or any other protected characteristic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One final thing: don&#39;t hold back. If you don&#39;t meet 100% of the criteria in this job description but you&#39;re certain you could make a big impact, apply. Everyone should have equal access to opportunities, and we&#39;re committed to providing an inclusive experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If Mews sounds like the kind of environment where you&#39;d thrive, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a> RND

Senior Business Solutions Partner, EMEA &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About Us:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Pacvue&amp;nbsp;is the leading Commerce Media OS, powering over $12B in advertising spend across 100+ global retail media networks including Amazon, Walmart, Target, Kroger, Instacart, Criteo, and&amp;nbsp;CitrusAd. Powered by industry-leading AI and real-time data,&amp;nbsp;Pacvue&amp;nbsp;enables over 70,000 brands and agencies to maximize advertising performance, drive incrementality, and expand reach across the commerce universe from a single mission control. As of 2025,&amp;nbsp;Pacvue&amp;nbsp;powers 12% of total retail media ad spend worldwide excluding China. Combined with Helium 10’s SMB solutions,&amp;nbsp;Pacvue&amp;nbsp;delivers the industry’s most comprehensive platform for businesses of all sizes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;At&amp;nbsp;Pacvue&amp;nbsp;and Helium 10, great careers&amp;nbsp;don’t&amp;nbsp;just happen —&amp;nbsp;they’re&amp;nbsp;built. Here,&amp;nbsp;you’ll&amp;nbsp;rise as an industry leader, push the boundaries of innovation, own your journey, and thrive as part of an inclusive global community&amp;nbsp;that’s&amp;nbsp;redefining the future of commerce.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About the&amp;nbsp;Role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;This is a client-facing role. The Business Solutions Partner spends the majority of their time working directly with clients — helping them unlock value from Pacvue’s platform, identifying the right solutions to their business challenges, and translating field insights into structured product feedback. It is a role for someone who is comfortable in front of customers, curious about technology, and motivated to sit at the intersection of commercial and product thinking.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The BSP brings deep knowledge about all Pacvue platforms and services to support client engagements and drive measurable product improvements. The role is designed to flex across the full client lifecycle as business needs evolve, working in close collaboration with the broader BSP team and cross-functional partners across Sales, Product, and Customer Success.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Client Engagement &amp;amp; Technical Solutioning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Client engagement is the primary focus of this role. The BSP is the technical face of Pacvue in client interactions, helping clients and internal teams identify the right parts of the platform and product suite to address real business challenges — including scoping custom approaches for more complex needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Work directly with clients to understand their objectives, identify gaps, and recommend solutions across Pacvue’s platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Partner with Sales, Account Management, Customer Success, and agency teams to support high-value engagements and post-sales technical guidance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Communicate platform capabilities clearly to a range of audiences — from hands-on practitioners to senior decision-makers — in person and virtually. Regular travel to client sites, industry events, and team meetings across EMEA is a key component of this role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
