Director, International Delivery Management - Professional Services &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elastic, the Search AI Company, enables everyone to find the answers they need in real time, using all their data, at scale — unleashing the potential of businesses and people. The Elastic Search AI Platform, used by more than 50% of the Fortune 500, brings together the precision of search and the intelligence of AI to enable everyone to accelerate the results that matter. By taking advantage of all structured and unstructured data — securing and protecting private information more effectively — Elastic’s complete, cloud-based solutions for search, security, and observability help organizations deliver on the promise of AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elastic is looking for an exceptional delivery consulting leader — someone who has built and run international delivery organisations, understands how to drive bookings growth and revenue expansion inside complex enterprise accounts, and can operate at the highest levels of client engagement while simultaneously leading and transforming a mid-sized, globally distributed team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own the international Delivery Management function across Elastic Professional Services — leading the team, driving the transformation, and acting as the senior client presence on our most strategic engagements. You will be accountable for both the operational health of the delivery organisation and the commercial outcomes it generates: bookings, revenue, and margin across EMEA and APJ.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Delivery excellence is your foundation. Commercial growth is your north star. Building the team that industrialises both — and equips it for an AI-enabled future — is your legacy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International Delivery Organisation — EMEA &amp;amp; APJ&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Own and lead the international Delivery Management function&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; a team of ~15 Delivery Managers today, distributed across global delivery hubs in EMEA and APJ — with a clear mandate and expectation to scale substantially through 2027 and 2028 as the practice grows and demand accelerates across both regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Drive a team transformation &lt;/strong&gt;— reframing how Delivery Managers operate, shifting from project execution to outcome-led consulting, equipping the team to hold more strategic client conversations and drive greater account value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Champion and drive the adoption of Fixed Price engagement models&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; leading the organisation through the commercial, contractual, and delivery discipline required to scope, price, and execute fixed-price engagements with confidence, especially with platform migrations — protecting margin while driving predictable, high-quality client outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Build a dual-mode delivery capability that operates with excellence across two distinct motions:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;①&amp;nbsp; Packaged Solutions&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; —&amp;nbsp; fast, repeatable, industrialised delivery of high-value outcome-based offerings at scale — anchored in Fixed Price commercial models.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;②&amp;nbsp; Transformative Engagements&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; —&amp;nbsp; large, complex migrations and solution delivery that require senior delivery governance, deep client partnership, and adaptive programme leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Lead the integration of AI into the Delivery Management function&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; identifying and embedding AI-powered tools and practices that improve team productivity, sharpen delivery insight, and — critically — enrich the client experience by enabling more proactive, personalised, and higher-value engagement throughout the delivery lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Design and embed delivery standards, frameworks, and tooling&lt;/strong&gt; — including AI-augmented capabilities — that enable the team to scale both delivery modes without sacrificing quality or client outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Act as a player-coach&lt;/strong&gt; — maintaining direct governance oversight on the most complex or at-risk international engagements, intervening and course-correcting where needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Build a coaching and development culture within the team&lt;/strong&gt; — raising the floor on delivery craft and the ceiling on consulting commerciality across every region working closely with the Regional Services Directors, to generate new opportunities on the back of outstanding delivery.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Leadership &amp;amp; Commercial Growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Own financial accountability across the international delivery portfolio&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; driving consulting bookings growth from delivery, maximising revenue realisation from engagements, and actively improving delivery margin through disciplined engagement management, Fixed Price adoption, and commercial rigour.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Grow the consulting footprint&lt;/strong&gt; within a portfolio of strategic enterprise accounts across EMEA and APJ, driving land-and-expand value outcomes in close partnership with regional Sales organisations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Build and sustain C-level and VP-level executive relationships&lt;/strong&gt; that extend beyond the project — becoming the trusted advisor clients return to for their most important decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸ &lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Develop compelling value narratives&lt;/strong&gt; that articulate the value of engaging Elastic&#39;s consulting services, influencing renewal, expansion, and new commercial commitments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸ &lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Partner with Regional Services Directors on pipeline development&lt;/strong&gt; — acting as a senior consulting delivery voice in pre-sales conversations, solution framing, and commercial structuring including Fixed Price proposals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional &amp;amp; Organisational Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Serve as the connective tissue between Consulting, Sales, Customer Success, and Product when driving an engagement — ensuring a unified client experience and shared accountability for outcomes across EMEA and APJ.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Contribute to the evolution of Elastic&#39;s delivery consulting go-to-market: methodology design, packaged solution development, delivery model innovation, AI-enabled tooling, and commercial frameworks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Represent Elastic Professional Services at the senior leadership level — internally and externally — with the credibility and presence to influence how the organisation grows internationally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;International enterprise leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; Proven track record building and leading delivery teams across EMEA and/or APJ. You understand how regional culture, client expectations, and hub-based delivery dynamics shape outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Fixed Price engagement expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; You have designed, sold, and delivered Fixed Price consulting engagements at scale. You understand the scoping rigour, risk management, and delivery discipline required to make this model work — and you have driven its adoption across a delivery organisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Financial accountability&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; You have owned a P&amp;amp;L or delivery portfolio with direct accountability for bookings, revenue, and margin — and you have a track record of improving all three.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Dual-mode delivery experience&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; You have designed and operated delivery models that handle both high-velocity repeatable engagements and complex, multi-stakeholder transformations — simultaneously.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;AI fluency in a delivery context&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; You have a clear point of view on how AI can transform delivery management and client engagement — and you have practical experience applying AI tools to improve team effectiveness, delivery quality, or customer outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Commercial acumen&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; You have expanded client accounts, shaped SOWs, and driven revenue growth from within a delivery or consulting organisation. You know how value conversations are won.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Executive presence&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; You are credible at the C-suite level across multiple geographies. You have built relationships that outlast individual projects and turned delivery success into long-term strategic partnership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;People leadership at scale&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; You have led and transformed mid-to-large delivery teams, building coaching cultures that raise performance and commerciality across a distributed, multi-timezone workforce.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;12+ years&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; in management consulting, professional services, or enterprise SaaS delivery leadership — with meaningful time spent in both client-facing growth roles and people/org leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Experience industrialising packaged service offerings — creating repeatable, Fixed Price delivery motions from complex, bespoke prior engagements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Hands-on experience deploying AI tools within a professional services or consulting delivery environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Background spanning pre-sales/solutioning and post-sales delivery — the full consulting lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Experience with enterprise SaaS platforms (e.g. Elastic, Salesforce, ServiceNow, Databricks) in a consulting or professional services capacity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Agile and hybrid delivery framework fluency in complex, multi-stakeholder enterprise environments, but with extensive experience of platform migrations / tools consolidation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Certifications (PMP, CSM, or equivalent) are valued, though leadership track record and client outcomes matter more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elastic&#39;s Professional Services organisation is at an inflection point internationally. We are scaling a delivery team across EMEA and APJ — with significant headcount growth expected through 2027 and 2028 — building a dual-mode delivery capability, shifting to Fixed Price engagement models, embedding AI into how we deliver and engage clients, and growing a client base that demands senior, outcome-focused leadership. All at once.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role carries real financial weight and a real transformation mandate. You will have the authority to reshape how an international team operates, the commercial platform to build lasting client partnerships across two major regions, and the executive visibility to influence how Elastic goes to market with its consulting capability globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have built delivery organisations, owned the numbers, led through transformation, embraced AI as a genuine force multiplier, and made Fixed Price work where others haven&#39;t — and you are looking for a role where all of it matters — this is it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Information - We Take Care of Our People&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a distributed company, diversity drives our identity. Whether you’re looking to launch a new career or grow an existing one, Elastic is the type of company where you can balance great work with great life. Your age is only a number. It doesn’t matter if you’re just out of college or your children are; we need you for what you can do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strive to have parity of benefits across regions and while regulations differ from place to place, we believe taking care of our people is the right thing to do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive pay based on the work you do here and not your previous salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health coverage for you and your family in many locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to craft your calendar with flexible locations and schedules for many roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous number of vacation days each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase your impact - We match up to $2000 (or local currency equivalent) for financial donations and service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 40 hours each year to use toward volunteer projects you love&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embracing parenthood with minimum of 16 weeks of parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Different people approach problems differently. We need that. Elastic is an equal opportunity employer and is committed to creating an inclusive culture that celebrates different perspectives, experiences, and backgrounds. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, ethnicity, color, religion, sex, pregnancy, sexual orientation, gender perception or identity, national origin, age, marital status, protected veteran status, disability status, or any other basis protected by federal, state or local law, ordinance or regulation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome individuals with disabilities and strive to create an accessible and inclusive experience for all individuals. To request an accommodation during the application or the recruiting process, please email &lt;a ----- ----- class=&quot;gmail_default&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;We will reply to your request within 24 business hours of submission.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Applicants have rights under Federal Employment Laws, view posters linked below:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/fmlaen.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Family and Medical Leave Act (FMLA)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Poster;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/ofccp/pdf/pay-transp_%20English_formattedESQA508c.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Pay Transparency Nondiscrimination Provision&lt;/a&gt; Poster; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/eppabw.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Employee Polygraph Protection Act (EPPA)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Poster and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/OFCCP/regs/compliance/posters/pdf/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Know Your Rights&lt;/a&gt; (Poster)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Elasticsearch develops and distributes technology and information that is subject to U.S. and other countries’ export controls and licensing requirements for individuals who are located in or are nationals of the following sanctioned countries and regions: Belarus, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Syria, or Russia, including the Ukrainian territories annexed by Russia (The Crimea region of Ukraine, The Donetsk People&#39;s Republic (DNR), The Luhansk People&#39;s Republic (LNR), Kherson or Zaporizhzhia). If you are located in or are a national of one of the listed countries or regions, an export license may be required as a condition of your employment in this role. Please note that national origin and/or nationality do not affect eligibility for employment with Elastic.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please see&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1611068262479000&amp;amp;usg=AFQjCNG3orAPk5sJIr9WVm0ZDxYw82c5DA&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for our Privacy Statement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Consulting - EMEA

Senior Growth Manager,  UK &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;c-message_kit__blocks c-message_kit__blocks--rich_text&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message__message_blocks c-message__message_blocks--rich_text&quot; data-qa=&quot;message-text&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-block_kit_renderer&quot; data-qa=&quot;block-kit-renderer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper--first&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;Reddit is a community of communities. It’s built on shared interests, passion, and trust, and is home to the most open and authentic conversations on the internet. Every day, Reddit users submit, vote, and comment on the topics they care most about. With 100,000+ active communities and approximately 130 million daily active unique visitors, Reddit is one of the internet’s largest sources of information. For more information, visit &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;http://www.redditinc.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://redditinc.com&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;www.redditinc.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;This role is based out of our London office.&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Growth Manager, UK on Reddit’s International Community team, you will be a key member of a cross-functional team responsible for deepening Reddit’s presence in the market. This is not a marketing role. Rather, you will drive user and ecosystem growth by building and scaling communities, executing local growth initiatives, coordinating cross-functional stakeholders, and leading initiatives that strengthen Reddit’s local ecosystem and user experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role combines strategic planning, growth-focused execution, cross-functional influence, market ownership, and community development. In this role, you will have a significant impact on shaping Reddit’s presence and success in the market, driving user and ecosystem growth at scale while strengthening engagement across local communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;User &amp;amp; Community Growth Strategies: &lt;/strong&gt;Establish and execute comprehensive strategies to grow the user base and nurture local communities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth Operations:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, launch, and scale local growth programs aimed at strengthening Reddit&#39;s ecosystem of users, communities, and contributors. Apply a creative, entrepreneurial approach by continuously testing and evaluating new ideas to reach your objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the local go-to person for providing market insights and local input to cross-functional teams, including Comms, Product, BD, and Marketing. Coordinate the execution of market-specific initiatives across multiple stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Data Ownership: &lt;/strong&gt;Monitor key country health KPIs and alert the appropriate teams in the event of significant changes (e.g., DAU, Contributions). Analyze performance trends, identify risks and opportunities, and develop action plans accordingly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Local representation: &lt;/strong&gt;Serve as a local spokesperson for Reddit, building influential relationships and partnerships both on and off the platform to reach and attract new audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Expect From You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or equivalent practical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in user growth, community growth, product operations, or country expansion, with a demonstrated track record of executing growth programs at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial spirit, strong execution skills and an ability to take initiative and drive projects independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong blend of operational, growth, data, and community/content expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building communities and/or growing a user base through on-the-ground initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven and analytical mindset, with proficiency in Excel modeling, working knowledge of SQL, and experience creating scalable processes and automations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for combining systems thinking with data analysis to drive impactful decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication and stakeholder management skills, with the ability to collaborate effectively across internal teams, users, content creators, and external partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Results-oriented mindset with a strong attention to detail and a bias toward execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of local market culture, including language, current events, politics, customs, traditions, topics of interest, and cultural sensitivities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global Benefit programs that fit your lifestyle, from workspace to professional development to caregiving support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Family Planning Support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gender-Affirming Care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental Health &amp;amp; Coaching Benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Group Personal Pension Scheme with Employer match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical and Dental Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Income Replacement Programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bike to Work scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Vacation &amp;amp; Paid Volunteer Time Off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous Paid Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us in fulfilling our mission of bringing community, belonging, and empowerment to the world, one community at a time. Become a driving force in shaping the future of Reddit&#39;s growth and success around the world.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;In select roles and locations, the interviews will be recorded, transcribed and summarized by artificial intelligence (AI). You will have the opportunity to opt out of recording, transcription and summarization prior to any scheduled interviews.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;During the interview, we will collect the following categories of personal information: Identifiers, Professional and Employment-Related Information, Sensory Information (audio/video recording), and any other categories of personal information you choose to share with us. We will use this information to evaluate your application for employment or an independent contractor role, as applicable.&amp;nbsp; We will not sell your personal information or disclose it to any third party for their marketing purposes.&amp;nbsp; We will delete any recording of your interview promptly after making a hiring decision.&amp;nbsp; For more information about how we will handle your personal information, including our retention of it, please refer to our &lt;a href=&quot;https://redditinc.com/policies/candidate-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy for Potential Employees and Contractors&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Reddit is proud to be an equal opportunity employer, and is committed to building a workforce representative of the diverse communities we serve.&amp;nbsp; Reddit is committed to providing reasonable accommodations for qualified individuals with disabilities and disabled veterans in our job application procedures. If, due to a disability, you need an accommodation during the interview process, please let your recruiter know.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Community  London

Senior Manager, Global Procurement (Materials) &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT QUINCE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quince is a destination for builders, creators, innovators, and operators who want to come together and challenge the status quo. Our mission is simple: make really high quality essentials for really low prices, fairly and sustainably. We deliver on that mission through a unique manufacturer-to-consumer (M2C) model eliminating the layers of traditional retail that add cost and result in consumers paying more than they need to. We find, build relationships with, and work directly with the manufacturing partners behind some of the world’s finest products. From there, our teams design smart, efficient operational processes&amp;nbsp; and build and deploy proprietary technology, AI, and analytics to help us scale fast.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What began with a small assortment of elevated basics has quickly grown into a cross-category brand spanning apparel, accessories, home goods, and more. Today, tens of millions of people across a growing number of countries come – and return – to Quince because they trust us to deliver.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR CULTURE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quince is a culture built for builders by builders. Our way of working starts with a blank sheet of paper. We question conventional thinking, use technology and data to uncover new opportunities, and move quickly to turn ideas into reality. We aren’t interested in replicating how others do retail. We’re building a better way – at a speed and scale unlike anything that’s been done before.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We dream big and chase the hard problems others shy away from. Rejecting long-held assumptions is part of our company&#39;s DNA.&amp;nbsp; Where conventional wisdom says you have to choose – soft or durable, speed or rigor, quality or price – we ask why that trade-off has to exist in the first place.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our pace is fast and the bar is high because our customers expect a lot from us and we refuse to let them down. We believe the best results come from challenging ourselves, learning from one another, and building on each other&#39;s strengths.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Here, responsibility is not determined by role, tenure, or seniority. Every team member - no matter their level - has the opportunity to drive our business and shape our trajectory.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re someone who likes to imagine new possibilities and build better systems rather than plug-in to outdated ones, Quince is the place for you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Open Roles&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior Manager, Global Raw Materials Procurement - Linen, Cotton &amp;amp; Other&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior Manager, Global Raw Materials Procurement - Cashmere &amp;amp; Silk&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior Manager, Global Raw Materials Procurement - Denim, Active &amp;amp; PKG Labels&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior Manager, Global Raw Materials Procurement - Leather &amp;amp; Down&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE IDEAL CANDIDATE:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;We are looking for an exceptional Senior Manager, Global Procurement [Materials] to own and drive cost structures and savings. This role is critical to our goal of delivering the highest quality products, at radically low prices -done right. Reporting to the Head of Procurement, the ideal candidate will leverage their deep expertise in commodity costing, clean sheet, manufacturing excellence &amp;amp; efficiency, harvest timing, raw material availability to craft a competitive costing environment where T2 and T3 suppliers are being challenged to provide transparent, and competitive pricing to achieve a win win supply chain for both Quince and our partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;Success in this role means achieving material cost at or near should-costing, below market indices, securing supply continuity, and contributing to product excellence by aligning material procurement with the company’s innovation and sustainability goals. This role offers the opportunity to make a significant impact on our business,contribute to company growth, and shape the future of our global procurement strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commodity Insights:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish a monitoring framework to forecast global market shifts, raw material fluctuations, currency risks, and macro-material trends. Deliver actionable intelligence to procurement and leadership on a regular cadence.
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;Build and operationalize a live tracking system for key raw material prices, currency movements, and supply risks to proactively surface threats and opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Upstream Cost Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Construct and scale material-specific clean sheets to lock in baseline component costs before finished-goods production. Provide the costing foundation for Tier 1 negotiations.
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;Build material-specific clean sheets for all top raw material inputs to create pricing transparency and support Tier 1 negotiation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;Support Buy Plan margin review to govern company margin target.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;Partner with material sourcing team to ensure transparent, competitive pricing from all key material suppliers (we own material, we own costing)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tier 2 (and Tier 3) Vendor Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Map and design an upstream network strategy to consolidate raw material volumes across key material types and maximize direct-to-mill leverage. Reduce supply chain complexity while improving cost and availability.&amp;nbsp;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;Complete mapping of the Tier 2 and Tier 3 vendor landscape and deliver a defined material and vendor strategy that reduces complexity, ensures capacity, and increases direct-to-mill buying power.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to integrate upstream material availability into product design and development cycles, ensuring early-stage cost optimization and seamless material-to-finished-good transitions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Material RFPs:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Design and execute RFPs tailored specifically to raw material vendors, yarn spinners/mills, tanneries, and textile mills. Own the full bidding process from vendor outreach through award.&amp;nbsp;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;Consistently deliver product exceptional material cost without sacrificing product quality or ESG considerations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;Negotiate and execute immediate cost-reduction agreements directly with Tier 2 material suppliers, while simultaneously institutionalizing repeatable negotiation frameworks to build long-term material maturity and sustainable competitive advantage.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;Partner directly with the Material Sourcing, Product Sourcing and Tier 1 and Tier 2 vendors to align on, and implement, material benefits into finished goods costing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value Creation: &lt;/strong&gt;Identify and execute on opportunities to reshape the supply chain and extract new financial value beyond traditional sourcing boundaries, including verticalization and volume consolidation plays.&amp;nbsp;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;E.g. How do we become a market maker for Cashmere, Silk, etc? Could we sell cashmere and silk to other retailers? How can we partner with other mills or manufacturers to build a verticalized supply chain for critical materials, like linen, from French/Belgian farms and scutchers to linen mills? How do we buy/sell commodities to manage price fluctuations (e.g. gold pricing, Cashmere pricing)?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;REQUIREMENTS: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12-15 years of experience in raw material sourcing, commodity procurement, or upstream supply chain management&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of textile raw materials including yarns, fibers, fabrics, leather, and related commodities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience negotiating directly with mills, tanneries, yarn spinners, and raw material vendors&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with commodity hedging frameworks and global market indices&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to build and execute material-specific clean sheets&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and financial modeling skills; comfort with large data sets&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical aptitude for leveraging AI-powered platforms (e.g., LLMs) to conduct scenario analysis and automate complex procurement tasks.Experience in upstream supply chain network design or consolidation preferred&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working cross-functionally with merchandising, sourcing, and production teams&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree required; MBA or advanced degree a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3319&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;WHY QUINCE?&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3352&quot;&gt;Joining Quince means being part of a mission-driven team reshaping retail. You will work alongside talented colleagues, tackle meaningful challenges, and contribute to building a more sustainable, accessible future for customers and partners alike.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3604&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;EQUAL OPPORTUNITY &amp;amp; HIRING INTEGRITY&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3662&quot;&gt;Quince provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applications for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran or military status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4074&quot;&gt;Quince is committed to providing reasonable accommodations to qualified individuals with disabilities. If you need a reasonable accommodation to complete your application or to perform the essential functions of a role at Quince, please let us know by completing &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/DpJ11jHa1WbqfUWB9&quot;&gt;this accommodation form&lt;/a&gt;. We review all requests individually and will work with you to determine appropriate accommodations on a case-by-case basis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4428&quot;&gt;Employment is contingent upon successful completion of a background check. Quince will conduct background checks in compliance with applicable federal, state, and local laws.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4604&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Security Advisory: Beware of Frauds&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4641&quot;&gt;At Quince, we&#39;re dedicated to recruiting top talent who share our drive for innovation. To safeguard candidates, Quince emphasizes legitimate recruitment practices. Initial communication is primarily via official Quince email addresses and LinkedIn; beware of deviations. Personal data and sensitive information will not be solicited during the application phase. Interviews are conducted via phone, in person, or through the approved platforms Google Meets or Zoom—never via messaging apps or other calling services. Offers are merit-based, communicated verbally, and followed up in writing. If personal information is requested to initiate the hiring process, rest assured it will be through secure and protected means.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5364&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Procurement

Banking Test Architect (m/w/d) &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wer wir sind&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als globale Unternehmensberatung mit Fokus auf die Finanzdienstleistungsbranche kombinieren wir bei Capco innovatives Denken mit einzigartigem Know-How. Wir entwickeln Lösungen, die exakt auf die speziellen Anforderungen unserer Kunden abgestimmt sind.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Was uns von anderen unterscheidet&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Unsere „Be Yourself At Work“-Kultur fördert Authentizität und Vielfalt: Jeder wird ermutigt, seine individuelle Perspektive, seine Persönlichkeit und seine Fähigkeiten einzubringen. Du hast jederzeit die Möglichkeit, Dich bei Capco mit Deinen Stärken einzubringen - sei es durch einen Beitrag an einer Initiative zur Entwicklung unserer Organisation, der Teilnahme an unseren Game Nights oder Du machst bei einem unserer zahlreichen Clubs (Sports Club, Music Club, usw.) mit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bring Dich ein und setze Deine Ideen bei Capco in die Tat um als &lt;strong&gt;Banking Test Architect (m/w/d).&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine Capco Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Arbeitsmodelle und hybrides Arbeiten je nach Projekteinsatz möglich&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ein umfassendes Onboarding und Dein persönlicher Coach und Buddy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bike Leasing Programm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capco Benefits Card mit monatlicher Gutschrift i.H.v. 44 EUR&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regelmäßige Gesundheitschecks sowie Mental Health Kurse&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Der PME-Familienservice bietet Unterstützung für alle Lebenslagen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kontinuierliches Feedback und Weiterbildungsmöglichkeiten (z.B. über interne Trainings und Udemy Business)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Großartige Firmenevents &amp;amp; After Work Veranstaltungen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unbefristeter Arbeitsvertrag&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autonomie, flache Hierarchien, Hands-on-Mentalität und schnelle Entscheidungswege&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ein dynamisches, wachstumsstarkes und internationales Umfeld mit zahlreichen Möglichkeiten Dich und Deine Talente einzubringen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unser Office direkt im Senckenberg-Turm in Frankfurt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine Capco Aufgaben&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;25&quot; data-end=&quot;407&quot;&gt;Wir suchen einen erfahrenen&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;53&quot; data-end=&quot;76&quot;&gt;Banking Test Architect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; (m/w/d)&lt;/strong&gt; zur Unterstützung eines groß angelegten Transformationsprogramms im Bankenumfeld. Der Test Architect arbeitet eng mit &lt;strong data-start=&quot;195&quot; data-end=&quot;290&quot;&gt;Business Architects, Delivery Management, Value Streams und weiteren wichtigen Stakeholdern&lt;/strong&gt; zusammen, um &lt;strong data-start=&quot;304&quot; data-end=&quot;369&quot;&gt;Scope, Szenarien und Testdesigns für die Bank Readiness Tests&lt;/strong&gt; zu definieren und weiterzuentwickeln.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;409&quot; data-end=&quot;764&quot;&gt;Die Rolle erfordert eine Kombination aus fundierter Banking-Expertise, umfassender Testerfahrung in großen Transformationsprogrammen, einer strukturierten Testmethodik sowie ausgezeichneten Fähigkeiten im Stakeholder Management. Der/Die erfolgreiche Kandidat/-in arbeitet in einem komplexen Multi-Plattform- und Multi-Applikationsumfeld mit internationalen Teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1nypyi1&quot; data-start=&quot;785&quot; data-end=&quot;964&quot;&gt;Definition und Weiterentwicklung von &lt;strong data-start=&quot;824&quot; data-end=&quot;897&quot;&gt;Scope, Ansatz, Szenarien und Testdesigns für die Bank Readiness Tests&lt;/strong&gt; in Abstimmung mit den relevanten Value Streams und Programmzielen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;165xc9v&quot; data-start=&quot;965&quot; data-end=&quot;1164&quot;&gt;Enge Zusammenarbeit mit &lt;strong data-start=&quot;991&quot; data-end=&quot;1038&quot;&gt;Business Architects und Delivery Management&lt;/strong&gt;, um Geschäftsprozesse, Transformationsanforderungen und Migrationsziele in umfassende End-to-End Testszenarien zu überführen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ysghdg&quot; data-start=&quot;1165&quot; data-end=&quot;1328&quot;&gt;Etablierung eines strukturierten Ansatzes für &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1213&quot; data-end=&quot;1277&quot;&gt;Testdesign, Testvorbereitung, Testdurchführung und Reporting&lt;/strong&gt; über mehrere Plattformen und Applikationen hinweg.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;6bbo8k&quot; data-start=&quot;1329&quot; data-end=&quot;1517&quot;&gt;Sicherstellung einer angemessenen Abdeckung von &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1379&quot; data-end=&quot;1407&quot;&gt;End-to-End Bankprozessen&lt;/strong&gt;, einschließlich Abhängigkeiten und Integrationspunkten zwischen Fachbereichen, Applikationen und Plattformen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1mymlvr&quot; data-start=&quot;1518&quot; data-end=&quot;1637&quot;&gt;Moderation von Workshops mit Stakeholdern aus Business, Technology, Testing und Delivery an verschiedenen Standorten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;16bqexh&quot; data-start=&quot;1638&quot; data-end=&quot;1748&quot;&gt;Koordination und Abstimmung der Testaktivitäten über internationale und funktionsübergreifende Teams hinweg.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;mlfcwd&quot; data-start=&quot;1749&quot; data-end=&quot;1943&quot;&gt;Identifikation von Testabhängigkeiten, Risiken, Lücken, Anforderungen an Testumgebungen und Readiness-Kriterien sowie Sicherstellung ihrer Berücksichtigung in der übergreifenden Teststrategie.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ht2o91&quot; data-start=&quot;1944&quot; data-end=&quot;2102&quot;&gt;Definition der Anforderungen an &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1978&quot; data-end=&quot;2036&quot;&gt;Multi-Plattform- und Multi-Applikations-Testumgebungen&lt;/strong&gt;, einschließlich relevanter Daten- und Integrationsabhängigkeiten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1mp53o&quot; data-start=&quot;2103&quot; data-end=&quot;2268&quot;&gt;Unterstützung bei der Planung und Durchführung von Tests im Zusammenhang mit &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2182&quot; data-end=&quot;2267&quot;&gt;Bankmigrationen, Integrationen und/oder Post-Merger-Integration (PMI) Aktivitäten&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1g4j2rr&quot; data-start=&quot;2269&quot; data-end=&quot;2428&quot;&gt;Bereitstellung von Testing-Expertise und Beratung auf Senior-Level für Value Streams und Programm-Stakeholder über den gesamten Transformationszyklus hinweg.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1005pqz&quot; data-start=&quot;2429&quot; data-end=&quot;2578&quot;&gt;Mitwirkung bei Test Governance, Quality Assurance, Defect Management und Readiness Assessments zur Unterstützung fundierter Go-live-Entscheidungen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein Capco Profil&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
