Senior Growth Consultant - PM &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hi, we’re Phiture — the mobile growth consultancy working with the teams behind leading apps like Adobe, Headspace, and LEGO® 👋. We’re setting the standard for growth in the brave new digital world, and we need great people to join our global team!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT TO EXPECT:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join Phiture as a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Growth Consultant, PM&lt;/strong&gt;, owning the day-to-day relationship, communication, and delivery for one of our largest and most demanding accounts. You&#39;ll act as one of the main points of contact for client communications, owning conversations and decisions directly with the client, orchestrating across PM, ASO, and Creative, while advising the Growth Lead on strategy and execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on, individual account-ownership role that requires both strong technical craftsmanship and genuine comfort leading client conversations. &lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll bring deep expertise in paid user acquisition for mobile apps, including GAC, Apple Search Ads, MMPs&lt;/strong&gt;, and attribution, and pair it with the confidence to represent the account&#39;s strategy directly to senior, demanding stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own Paid UA Campaign Management&lt;/strong&gt;: Own the end-to-end strategy, setup, and continuous optimization of paid campaigns (Google App Campaigns, Apple Search Ads, Meta Ads and other UA channels as relevant) to scale user acquisition efficiently, proactively monitoring spend efficiency and creative performance, and independently investigating technical issues (tracking discrepancies, delivery problems, attribution mismatches) before escalating.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Client Relationship&lt;/strong&gt;: Own the client relationship end-to-end with day-to-day communication, deliverables (reports, proposals, strategic planning docs), and hands-on execution of the agreed strategy. Lead client meetings, educate clients beyond reporting, and communicate the real, accurate cause of any issue, including when it traces back to our own setup or execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead, Not Just Attend, Client Conversations&lt;/strong&gt;: Confidently drive client meetings, questioning client requests that don&#39;t hold up, proactively bringing recommendations rather than waiting to be asked, and representing the account&#39;s strategic direction directly to senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connect PM to ASO and Creative&lt;/strong&gt;: Actively bring the organic and creative perspective into paid conversations (and vice versa) rather than staying within a single channel, by flagging cross-functional implications to the wider team without needing to be prompted.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply App-Specific Paid Media Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;: Bring deep expertise in paid user acquisition specifically for mobile apps, SDKs and their implementation, SKAN&#39;s measurement restrictions and their implications for testing and attribution, and what an MMP does and why app marketers rely on one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analyze Performance &amp;amp; Drive Recommendations&lt;/strong&gt;: Dive deep into monthly metrics, set targets, analyze trends, and independently identify areas of concern or opportunity, arriving with a point of view and a recommendation grounded in the numbers, translated into what it means for the client&#39;s business. Comfort reading dashboards in a tool like Looker Studio is expected.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guide Client POCs &amp;amp; Junior Team Members&lt;/strong&gt;: Guide Client POCs and junior team members as they build expertise, while retaining individual ownership of your own accounts. Given a problem, investigate it, propose a course of action, follow through, and close the loop with stakeholders without needing reminders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL NEED:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ years of hands-on experience in paid user acquisition / performance marketing&lt;/strong&gt;, for mobile apps, with a track record of demonstrable results (efficiency gains, scaled spend, measurable campaign impact) you can speak to concretely.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solid app-specific paid UA fluency&lt;/strong&gt;: including GAC, Meta Ads, Apple Search Ads, SDKs, SKAN, and MMP concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on attribution/MMP experience&lt;/strong&gt;: comfortable troubleshooting tracking and attribution issues directly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Genuine confidence leading client meetings&lt;/strong&gt;: with a track record of proactively driving conversations and pushing back on client asks when warranted.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Independent data interpretation skills&lt;/strong&gt;: able to arrive at a point of view and recommendation grounded in the numbers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluent in English, with excellent written and spoken client communication skills&lt;/strong&gt; and being able to simplify technical concepts for less growth-literate stakeholders without losing substance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A demonstrated track record of proactive ownership&lt;/strong&gt;: able to walk through a real past troubleshooting or client-management example.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NICE TO HAVE:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience with kids/family-audience apps&lt;/strong&gt; or highly regulated/brand-sensitive clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Familiarity with programmatic/DSP media buying&lt;/strong&gt; is a big plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience working alongside a dedicated data/attribution specialist&lt;/strong&gt;: comfortable collaborating closely with a technical counterpart.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER YOU:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Remote Work&lt;/strong&gt; — Unlimited remote work within your home country (EMEA), plus up to 90 days per year internationally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generous Vacation Allowance&lt;/strong&gt; — Enjoy up to 30 days of paid vacation annually, plus extra days for special occasions (country-specific), so you can recharge and pursue your passions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quarterly Bonus Opportunities&lt;/strong&gt; — Boost your earnings through our quarterly bonus scheme, directly linked to our shared success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mental Wellness Prioritized&lt;/strong&gt; — Free, confidential mental health support from licensed therapists through our partnership with Oliva.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personal Development Investment&lt;/strong&gt; — €1,000 annual personal growth budget and 10 dedicated learning hours each month, empowering your continuous growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Working Hours&lt;/strong&gt; — Shape your workday around your lifestyle and productivity, choosing working patterns that best suit you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vibrant Berlin Office&lt;/strong&gt; — Enjoy a flexible, pet-friendly workspace at our spacious headquarters located in one of Berlin’s most vibrant neighborhoods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Team Connection&lt;/strong&gt; — Regular team-building events and a memorable annual all-expenses-paid company offsite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tailored Career Growth&lt;/strong&gt; — A personalized career roadmap and development plan designed to keep you advancing professionally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Home Office Allowance&lt;/strong&gt; — Monthly remote-work cash allowance to level up your home workspace or help cover internet costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Premium Onboarding Kit&lt;/strong&gt; — Branded Phiture gear and your very own MacBook from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thoughtful Celebrations&lt;/strong&gt; — Responsibly sourced birthday, anniversary, and seasonal gifts, because every milestone deserves recognition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We encourage all qualified individuals to apply, regardless of their age, gender identity, ethnicity, sexual orientation, disability status, or religion. We celebrate diversity and are excited about building teams that represent a variety of backgrounds, perspectives, and skills. All employment decisions are based on qualifications, merit, and business needs.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Growth Marketing

Senior Manager, Enterprise Sales (London, United Kingdom) &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Figma is growing our team of passionate creatives and builders on a mission to make design accessible to all. Figma’s platform helps teams bring ideas to life—whether you&#39;re brainstorming, creating a prototype, translating designs into code, or iterating with AI. From idea to product, Figma empowers teams to streamline workflows, move faster, and work together in real time from anywhere in the world. If you&#39;re excited to shape the future of design and collaboration, join us!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Manager, Enterprise Sales to join our team of creatives, engineers, marketers, and brilliant business folks. You aren&#39;t the typical sales leader, and we aren&#39;t the typical design tool company. At Figma, we challenge assumptions and remove the constraints that block our imagination every day, and we expect you to do the same. With this role, you&#39;ll get in at the ground floor in a fast-growing sales org. You&#39;ll consult with our existing customer base and potential customers to build meaningful relationships that add value to the customer experience and revenue to our bottom line.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Our next team member will have an agile, dynamic mindset, be comfortable embracing change, be a true team-player, and love working with our growing footprint of Fortune 1000 customers. You won&#39;t be alone! Figma has an incredible team, and you&#39;ll work closely with other groups including Support, Design, Engineering, Product Marketing, Customer Success, and Community. As a Senior Manager, Enterprise Sales, you will lead a team of Account Executives responsible for continuing the growth of our Enterprise products. You will report directly to our Head of Sales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;This is a full-time role that can be held from our London hub.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do at Figma:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Lead a team of motivated and diverse individuals to foster an environment of success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Participate in customer and prospect meetings alongside your team to support deal progression and coach in real time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Assist in continual training and development, including mentorship, hiring, and career growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Help shape and further develop sales processes and initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Interview, hire, and train new team members as we scale the business and company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Deliver weekly forecast meetings and advise Account Executives on strategies to help exceed their goal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;d love to hear from you if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;7+ years of sales experience (preferably within SaaS) with 2+ years of management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Understanding of our technical and competitive landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Ability to thrive in a constantly changing and evolving environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Exceptional coaching, writing, discovery, and presentation skills and excitement for increasing customer happiness and developing lasting customer relationships through strong discovery and partnership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Proven track record of leading successful and consistent sales teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;At Figma, one of our values is Grow as you go. We believe in hiring smart, curious people who are excited to learn and develop their skills. If you&#39;re excited about this role but your past experience doesn&#39;t align perfectly with the points outlined in the job description, we encourage you to apply anyways. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Figma we celebrate and support our differences. We know employing a team rich in diverse thoughts, experiences, and opinions allows our employees, our product and our community to flourish. Figma is an &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2022-10/EEOC_KnowYourRights_screen_reader_10_20.pdf&quot;&gt;equal opportunity workplace&lt;/a&gt; - we are dedicated to equal employment opportunities regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity/expression, veteran status&lt;strong&gt;, &lt;/strong&gt;or any other characteristic protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will work to ensure individuals with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodation to apply for a role, participate in the interview process, perform essential job functions, and receive other benefits and privileges of employment. If you require accommodation, please reach out to &lt;a ---------- These modifications enable an individual with a disability to have an equal opportunity not only to get a job, but successfully perform their job tasks to the same extent as people without disabilities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Examples of accommodations include but are not limited to:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Holding interviews in an accessible location&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enabling closed captioning on video conferencing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring all written communication be compatible with screen readers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changing the mode or format of interviews&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To ensure the integrity of our hiring process and facilitate a more personal connection, we require all candidates keep their cameras on during video interviews. Additionally, if hired you will be required to attend in person onboarding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By applying for this job, the candidate acknowledges and agrees that any personal data contained in their application or supporting materials will be processed in accordance with &lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://www.figma.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.figma.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Figma&#39;s Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Sales  London

Software Engineer (Elite Motorsport) &lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Software Engineer (Motorsport)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DO YOU WANT TO WORK FOR THE WORLD LEADER IN ELITE SPORTS PERFORMANCE ANALYTICS?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Catapult is a world leader in sports performance technology, serving over 5,000 teams across 40 sports. We improve many of your favorite athletes&#39; performances with our wearable tracking technology, video and data analysis systems, and athlete management products. Our technology offers objective solutions to sport-based challenges and can be found throughout the NFL, NHL, NBA, AFL, NRL, Premier League, Bundesliga, La Liga and many more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In Motorsport, Catapult’s SBG race management and team strategy systems are the technology of choice for elite-level organisers and competitors around the world, including in Formula 1, Formula E, IndyCar, NASCAR, WEC/Le Mans and other worldwide endurance racing. Customers include the FIA, nine Formula 1 teams - including the 8-time World Champion Mercedes AMG Petronas F1 Team - the majority of Formula E teams, the winners of multiple Le Mans 24-hour races over the last 10 years - Audi, Porsche, and Toyota - and teams and organisers in both IndyCar and NASCAR.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have major offices in the UK (London and Leeds), USA (Boston) and Australia (Melbourne) as well as multiple smaller offices around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WE WANT PEOPLE WHO ARE PASSIONATE ABOUT SPORTS AND WANT TO WIN&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a talented and enthusiastic &lt;strong&gt;Software Engineer (Motorsport)&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to grow our Motorsport development team as we expand our RaceWatch products into new series and tackle new challenges.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Based in the London office (3 days a week), you will be a key player in developing new capabilities in RaceWatch, focussing on one or two racing series, and also contributing to the entire RaceWatch suite.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We believe that our customers deserve the best platform, and we are on a mission to maximise and enhance their performance through delivering the highest quality experience. As a Software Engineer, you will help us drive our products and processes forward. You will be able to excel in a fast-paced environment with short project timelines from conception to deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development of our RaceWatch software for one or more motorsport series.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with product managers and customers to design features and prioritise tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify ways to add innovative new features to the software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and maintain efficient, reusable, and reliable code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to code quality, organization, and best practices throughout the development process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and enhance software reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL NEED&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in computer science, or another scientific or technical subject.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for sport.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years working in a fast-paced, technical environment, delivering software to customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of building applications in C/C++, or another object-oriented language.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing products, scaling them, and supporting them throughout the entire lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An aptitude for working with complex data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal skills and an ability to communicate effectively with technical and non-technical staff, both internally and when speaking to customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A willingness to go above and beyond for the customer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to help cover live motorsport events at weekends on a rotational basis with the rest of the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An ability to multi-task and thrive in a dynamic work environment with changing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NICE TO HAVE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing Windows applications in Visual Studio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing applications that process video.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ticketing and project management platforms, such as JIRA or Monday.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience working in motorsport is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY CATAPULT?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have amazing people. We can promise you will work with some of the most ambitious and intelligent people in an exciting industry, and you will do some of the best work of your life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We encourage our people to have constructive, open and honest communication; to make Catapult extraordinary; innovate and create smart solutions; establish a collaborative, yet challenging, environment to develop our performance and the performance of our customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our workforce spans more than 20 countries so you’ll have the opportunity to work across multiple nationalities and cultures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We value improvement and development. We are challenging ourselves to continuously grow and become a high-performance company. That means we maintain a growth mindset in everything we do, and our people are always looking for ways to do things better. There is unlimited opportunity to grow, do more, and do better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We care about you. We offer outstanding paid maternity and paternity leave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Whether you are interested in sports or not, you’ll have the satisfaction of knowing your work is supporting some of the most successful teams, organisations and competitors on the planet! While we have access to many exciting opportunities, we also realize that we are here to do a very important job for our customers. As a result, we aim to work with purpose and intention. We look for people that fit into our team culture, those who actively contribute and individuals who are excited about what they do.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In order to build the future of sports performance, we need the brightest talent. If you think you can contribute to the empowering, enjoyable and exciting Catapult environment, then we invite you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All offers of employment are subject to Catapult&#39;s positive prehire check. To find out more, please contact the Talent Partner for this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Motorsport  London

Senior Software Engineer &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SENIOR SOFTWARE ENGINEER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Catapult is building the future of sports performance technology, with a mission to &lt;strong&gt;Unleash the Potential&lt;/strong&gt; of every athlete and team on earth. We don&#39;t just work in the sporting industry; we are actively changing it.&amp;nbsp; Since 2006, our solutions have been leading the way in sports performance software, science, and data, in a world where 1% can literally mean the difference between winning and losing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We work with over 5,000+ teams around the world, empowering coaches, managers and trainers in premier teams in the NFL, NBA, NHL, MLS, EPL, AFL, NRL, NCAA and more. We provide the information they need to optimize athletes’ health, game-day readiness, and performance, as well as in-game tactics.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Catapult is a sports technology company that empowers professional teams to make data-driven decisions. We deliver health, performance, video, and AI insights from the locker room to competitive environments, ensuring every decision is an opportunity to gain an advantage, sharpen performance, and build lasting success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WE WANT PEOPLE WHO ARE PASSIONATE ABOUT SOLVING HARD PROBLEMS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to help build the Perch camera system,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Based in London (hybrid), you will work across platform, perception, and ML systems. You will help us improve how we collect, process, and analyze performance data at scale, spanning from devices collecting real-time to backend services and ML infrastructure. All of which will have a direct impact on customers and their experiences with the product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role suits a strong generalist who has seen many parts of engineering. You might have worked on any of the following: high-throughput systems, computer vision, robotics, ML infrastructure, or other complex applications. Our ideal candidate brings strong engineering judgment, good technical range, and the ability to learn quickly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be hands-on, working in Python and C++ on devices and services in use by our customers every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Design and implement algorithms for 3D object tracking, segmentation, and motion recognition on embedded hardware.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Train and iterate on ML models — from dataset curation through training, evaluation, and deployment to edge devices.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Help bring ML, computer vision, or signal-processing systems into production with tight performance constraints&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Build reliable application features and services that customers use in real environments.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Analyze production data to find system limits, product issues, and opportunities for improvement.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Collaborate closely with the embedded platform team on model optimization and inference performance, and with the applications team on how tracking data becomes product features.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL NEED&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;4+ years of software engineering experience in production systems.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Strong skill in Python and backend engineering.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Working knowledge of C++ or a strong reason to be effective in performance-critical code.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Experience with data-intensive systems, distributed systems, parallel processing, or efficient data pipelines.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Exposure to ML, ML infrastructure, signal processing, real-time systems, computer vision, or related applied technical areas.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;A track record of shipping reliable software, not only prototypes.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Strong debugging skills and the ability to find the root cause of complex system behavior.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Clear communication and good judgment when tradeoffs are not simple.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Curiosity, adaptability, and the desire to learn new technical areas.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Nice to have — and what would make you exceptional:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with computer vision, depth cameras, pose estimation, tracking, or 3D data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ML model deployment, feature pipelines, evaluation systems, or data quality tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with streaming data, event systems, real-time processing, or low-latency applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with numerical methods, signal processing, filtering, state estimation, or robotics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOUR SUCCESS WILL LOOK LIKE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In 6 months time, you understand the main systems, ship reliable changes, and help improve a meaningful data or product workflow. You give valuable technical input towards solving problems across backend, data, and perception systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In 12 months time, you have made a measurable impact on system reliability, product capability, or data quality. You own important parts of the architecture and help the team make better technical decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY CATAPULT?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have amazing people. We promise you’ll work with some of the most ambitious,&amp;nbsp; intelligent people in an exciting industry, and do some of the best work of your life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We encourage our people to engage in constructive, open, and honest communication to make Catapult extraordinary.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We work in a collaborative yet challenging environment to consistently improve our performance, which in turn impacts our customers&#39; performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our workforce spans more than 20 countries. You&#39;ll have the opportunity to work with people from multiple nationalities and cultures, and to build your global awareness.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We value improvement and development. We are challenging ourselves to continuously grow and become a high-performance company. That means we maintain a growth mindset in everything we do, and our people are always looking for ways to improve.&amp;nbsp; There is an unlimited opportunity to grow, do more, and do better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Whether you’re interested in sports or not, you’ll have the satisfaction of knowing your work is supporting some of the most successful teams and athletes on the planet!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Research shows that while men apply for jobs when they meet an average of 60% of the criteria, women and other marginalized groups tend only to apply when they check every box. So if you have what it takes, but don&#39;t meet every single point in our job ad, please still get in touch! We would love to have a chat and see if you could be a great addition to our team. We are building the future of sports performance. Our priority is to find the brightest talent who can add to our team culture, actively contribute, and be excited about what they do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All offers of employment are subject to Catapult&#39;s positive prehire check. To find out more, please contact the Talent Partner for this role.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Gym Monitoring  London

Principal Software Engineer &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;m_8220454926977230902gmail-docs-internal-guid-9a9f34f4-7fff-014a-c97c-98ca90610a47&quot;&gt;Algolia is the retrieval intelligence layer that turns intent into trusted, decision-grade outcomes. Powering more than 1.7 trillion queries a year for over 18,000 customers with millisecond latency and 99.999% reliability, we are the recognized leader for Search and Product Discovery by top industry analyst firms. The Algolia platform turns a company&#39;s products, content, and business rules into data that humans, applications and AI agents can act upon. The result is trusted customer experiences with stronger conversions for measurable business impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re a problem solver, able to think outside the box and eager to nurture others and learn from them, then this is your challenge!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;principal engineer working across the entire frontend stack&lt;/strong&gt;, from design-system primitives to product-level architecture, you will shape how developers build with Algolia and how customers experience our products.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the Frontend Experiences team, we&#39;re on a mission to make it effortless for developers to &lt;strong&gt;build great search and discovery experiences on the front end&lt;/strong&gt;, with libraries, components and tooling that are fast, accessible, and a pleasure to use. Our work reaches customers and their end users directly, on the web and on mobile, so the quality bar is high and the feedback loop is short.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Right now, that includes a cross-team, multi-quarter effort to &lt;strong&gt;evolve the Algolia Dashboard&lt;/strong&gt; from a collection of product surfaces into one coherent environment: a new navigation and information architecture, a shared component foundation, and an interaction model that supports traditional configuration, conversational assistance and agentic workflows side by side.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The team is looking for an experienced individual who is well versed in defining, building and operating scalable architectures, with proven strengths in cross-team collaboration, taking solutions all the way through delivery to adoption by other engineering teams and by customers. You will play a pivotal role in architecting and implementing systems that play a central role across all of Algolia&#39;s front-end products, including libraries that run in production on thousands of customer sites. You will also play a role in training/mentoring and leading team members.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR ROLE WILL CONSIST OF:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Defining the multi-year technical vision&lt;/strong&gt; for Algolia&#39;s front-end platform, and turning it into roadmaps and projects that several teams can execute;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Playing an active role in the evolution of the Algolia Dashboard&lt;/strong&gt;: shaping the experience architecture, the component strategy and the technical foundations for conversational and agentic UX, and partnering with engineering, product and design leadership to sequence delivery;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Driving convergence on a shared component library&lt;/strong&gt;, reducing duplicated components and inconsistent patterns across product surfaces;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Designing and delivering solutions&lt;/strong&gt; that will scale with significant volumes, be highly available, performant and resilient, including on pages and apps we do not control;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Owning solutions&lt;/strong&gt;, taking them all the way through delivery to adoption by engineering teams and customers;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shaping API design, versioning and backward-compatibility strategy&lt;/strong&gt; for public libraries used by a large developer community;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Embodying technical expertise&lt;/strong&gt;, that the team can refer to for advice or validation of a solution;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Setting engineering standards and best practices&lt;/strong&gt; to be followed by engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOU MIGHT BE A FIT IF YOU HAVE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and organization skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;10+ years of experience&lt;/strong&gt;, with a track record of setting technical direction across multiple teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience as a &lt;strong&gt;thought leader/standard-bearer&lt;/strong&gt; for engineers, inside and outside the company (talks, open source, writing)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience &lt;strong&gt;leading engineers on large, cross-cutting projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience &lt;strong&gt;designing full stack solutions&lt;/strong&gt;, interacting with microservice architectures, and strong grounding beyond the frontend (APIs, backend services, delivery infrastructure) to make sound end-to-end trade-offs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep frontend expertise&lt;/strong&gt; (TypeScript, modern web platform, React and other major frameworks, accessibility, bundle size and runtime performance)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience &lt;strong&gt;designing and maintaining public libraries, SDKs or design systems&lt;/strong&gt;, with a feel for API ergonomics and a track record of managing breaking changes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience &lt;strong&gt;building complex, high traffic &amp;amp; multi products web applications&lt;/strong&gt; such as dashboards or admin consoles, and leading cross-team UI consolidation efforts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in &lt;strong&gt;conversational and agentic interfaces&lt;/strong&gt; (chat, streaming responses, tool-driven workflows) and in the architecture needed to support them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with search UX patterns and with generative AI and agentic experiences is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preference for candidates with experience at our current stage and beyond (over 10,000 customers, $50-200M ARR range, high growth, lots of change and building internal infrastructure).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;uil-fw-normal uil-ff-hind uil-fsz-16 lg:uil-fsz-18 uil-lh-bigger uil-color-grey-700&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Algolia does not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, sex, age, national origin, military status, veteran status, disability status, sexual orientation, gender identity, genetic information, or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The annual base salary compensation range for this role reflects market pay data within this location. The exact compensation offered for this role may vary depending on specific location and job-related knowledge, technical skills, and experience; and is only one part of our Total Rewards philosophy to compensate and recognize employees for their work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Salary Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€108.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€135.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FLEXIBLE WORKPLACE STRATEGY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Algolia’s flexible workplace model is designed to empower all Algolians to fulfill our mission to power search and discovery with ease. We place an emphasis on an individual’s impact, contribution, and output, over their physical location. Algolia is a high-trust environment and many of our team members have the autonomy to choose where they want to work and when.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a global presence with offices in Paris, NYC, London, Sydney and Bucharest, however we also offer many of our team members the option to work remotely either as fully remote or hybrid-remote employees.&lt;strong&gt; Positions listed as &quot;Remote&quot; are only available for remote work within the specified country. Positions listed within a specific city are only available in that location - depending on the role it may be available with either a hybrid-remote or in-office schedule.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WE’RE LOOKING FOR SOMEONE WHO CAN LIVE OUR VALUES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GRIT&lt;/strong&gt; - Problem-solving and perseverance capability in an ever-changing and growing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TRUST &lt;/strong&gt;- Willingness to trust our co-workers and to take ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CANDOR&lt;/strong&gt; - Ability to receive and give constructive feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CARE&lt;/strong&gt; - Genuine care about other team members, our clients and the decisions we make in the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HUMILITY&lt;/strong&gt; - Aptitude for learning from others, putting ego aside.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for talented, passionate people to help build the world’s best search and discovery technology. We value autonomy, diversity, and collaboration. We’re committed to creating an inclusive workplace where everyone is respected and supported—regardless of race, age, ancestry, religion, sex, gender identity, sexual orientation, marital status, color, veteran status, disability, or socioeconomic background.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IMPORTANT NOTICE FOR CANDIDATES - Recruitment Fraud Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve recently seen an increase in recruitment scams targeting job seekers. To help protect yourself, please keep the following in mind:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our open positions may appear on third-party job boards, but the &lt;strong&gt;best way to apply safely&lt;/strong&gt; is directly through our &lt;strong&gt;careers page&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;All genuine communication from Algolia will come from an ----- email address. If you receive an email from someone claiming to work at Algolia who does not have an ----- email address, please do not respond or share any personal information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’ll &lt;strong&gt;never ask for payments, purchases, or financial details&lt;/strong&gt; during the hiring process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;READY TO APPLY?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you share our values and our enthusiasm for building the world’s best search &amp;amp; discovery technology, we’d love to review your application!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a> R&D  Paris

Business Development Director – Supply Chain Center of Excellence (CoE) &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 110, 153);&quot;&gt;What Cognite is:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 41, 255);&quot;&gt;Relentless&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 110, 153);&quot;&gt;to achieve&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Cognite operates at the forefront of &lt;strong&gt;industrial digitalization, building AI&lt;/strong&gt;, and data solutions that solve the world’s hardest, highest-impact problems. With unmatched industrial heritage and a comprehensive suite of AI capabilities, including low-code AI agents, Cognite accelerates the digital transformation to drive operational improvements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We thrive in challenges. We challenge assumptions. We execute with speed and ownership. If you view obstacles as signals to step forward - not backwards - you’ll feel right at home here.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cognite.com/en/company/newsroom/cognite-s-industrial-ai-momentum-soars-driving-ecosystem-impact-at-global-conference&quot;&gt;Moonshot&lt;/a&gt; is bold: Unlock $100B in customer value by 2035, and redefine how global industry works. Join us in this venture where AI and data meet ingenuity, and together, we will forge the path to a smarter, more connected industrial future.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 100%;&quot; width=&quot;708&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Field / Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel:&lt;/strong&gt; Approximately 50% (Client sites, etc)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Cognite&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cognite is a global industrial Software-as-a-Service (SaaS) company enabling the full-scale digital transformation of heavy-asset industries. Our core software product, Cognite Data Fusion (CDF), powers companies with contextualized OT/IT data to develop and scale solutions that increase safety, sustainability, and operational efficiency while driving revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Business Development Director within our Supply Chain Center of Excellence (CoE)&lt;/strong&gt;, you will drive Cognite’s growth by winning new Supply Chain business within accounts headquartered in your territory. Operating as a subject matter expert, you will leverage deep domain insights to help customers transform their supply chain value chain using Cognite Applications and the Cognite Data Fusion Platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Territory &amp;amp; CoE Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and execute a targeted territory strategy to accelerate bookings growth and secure high-impact supply chain clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pipeline Generation:&lt;/strong&gt; Actively prospect and leverage your personal network to generate pipeline, providing compelling &quot;commercial insights&quot; on optimizing the supply chain value chain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Complex Sales Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead extended territory teams (including pre-sales and technical experts) through complex enterprise sales cycles to exceed bookings targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value-Based Selling:&lt;/strong&gt; Quantify ROI and present strong business cases to help enterprise executives justify software investments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner-savvy:&lt;/strong&gt; work with partners to qualify and progress their pipeline, and drive joint engagements on qualified opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deal Negotiation:&lt;/strong&gt; Support the Account / Engagement Leader in negotiating favorable pricing and commercial terms with C-level executives by demonstrating the long-term strategic value of Cognite’s solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with internal Product Management and Marketing teams to feed real-market supply chain insights back into product strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Hygiene &amp;amp; Forecasting:&lt;/strong&gt; Support the Account Leaders and their First Line Managers in accurately forecasting monthly/quarterly bookings and maintaining up-to-date account records in &lt;a href=&quot;http://salesforce.com&quot;&gt;Salesforce.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge, Skills, Abilities (KSAs) &amp;amp; Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Competencies:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain &amp;amp; Industry Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep domain expertise in complex Supply Chain operations for Energy, Manufacturing or Power Utilities verticals. Understanding of Production operations and industry x.0 initiatives is also required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Value Selling:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to sell value and build quantified ROI frameworks for prospective buyers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Informal Leadership, Influence &amp;amp; Autonomy:&lt;/strong&gt; High degree of self-motivation, time management, and ability to informally lead and effectively influence cross-functional deal teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Stellar presentation, written, and verbal communication skills tailored for C-suite engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
