Senior FP&A Finance Specialist &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure (NYSE: P) has evolved from storage pioneer to data platform, closing fiscal 2026 with $3.7 billion in revenue, its first billion-dollar quarter, and accelerating growth into FY27. Our strategic agenda spans the companies defining the next era of technology - hyperscalers, AI labs, the AI hardware supply chain, data platform providers, and the broader AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an &lt;strong&gt;EMEA Sales Senior Finance Specialist to support our EMEA Sales organization.&lt;/strong&gt; This highly visible and commercially focused role will partner closely with &lt;strong&gt;EMEA Sales and Finance leadership&lt;/strong&gt; to provide value-added financial analysis, business intelligence, and strategic insights that support business performance and go-to-market decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will analyze &lt;strong&gt;pipeline, bookings, deals, customer buying patterns, expenses, and other leading performance indicators&lt;/strong&gt;, translating complex financial and operational data into clear, forward-looking narratives and forecasts. You will also partner with our &lt;strong&gt;Shared Services team&lt;/strong&gt; to strengthen financial models, analytics, and reporting while driving planning, expense management, process standardization, and automation as the business scales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Finance &amp;amp; Business Partnership&lt;/strong&gt;: Partner closely with EMEA Sales leadership and the Deal Desk, providing financial and commercial analysis that supports deal decisions, go-to-market strategy, resource allocation, and business growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting &amp;amp; Business Analytics&lt;/strong&gt;: Analyze business trends, customer buying patterns, pipeline, deals, and market performance to deliver actionable insights that inform go-to-market strategy and measure execution effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Modeling &amp;amp; Planning&lt;/strong&gt;: Partner with the Shared Services team to build and maintain critical business and financial models covering headcount, expenses, commissions, pipeline, and bookings, translating complex information into clear, decision-ready insights for financial and non-financial stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forecasting &amp;amp; Performance Management&lt;/strong&gt;: Translate financial and operational performance into forward-looking narratives and forecasts aligned with underlying business and market insights. Drive financial planning, forecasting, and reporting activities, including &lt;strong&gt;Expense-to-Bookings (E:B)&lt;/strong&gt; reporting and analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expense Management &amp;amp; Budget Control&lt;/strong&gt;: Drive expense management activities for EMEA Sales teams, monitoring performance against budget plans, identifying financial risks and opportunities, and supporting effective cost control and resource allocation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Business Support&lt;/strong&gt;: Provide financial and analytical support to the &lt;strong&gt;EMEA Sales team and International Sales AVP&lt;/strong&gt; on strategic initiatives, special projects, and key business priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Improvement &amp;amp; Automation&lt;/strong&gt;: Drive continuous process improvement by leveraging best practices, standardization, analytics, and automation to improve reporting, increase efficiency, and support business scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in FP&amp;amp;A or Commercial Finance roles, with experience building dashboards and supporting business decision-making through financial analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency in financial analysis and modeling, with the ability to provide timely reporting and continue driving data analytics automation for the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong systems experience with &lt;strong&gt;Tableau, Salesforce, Anaplan, NetSuite, Callidus&lt;/strong&gt;, or similar systems and tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to understand the story behind the numbers and translate complex financial and operational data into clear, forward-looking insights, forecasts, and management-level narratives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A highly motivated, self-starting approach, with the ability to work independently in a fast-paced and ambiguous environment while managing multiple priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail, combined with the ability to synthesize large volumes of data into clear presentations and management-level views.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the &lt;strong&gt;technology industry or Sales Finance&lt;/strong&gt; is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, with a collaborative approach and strong cross-functional partnership skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BA/BS degree in &lt;strong&gt;Finance, Accounting, Economics&lt;/strong&gt;, or an equivalent field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CIMA Studier / Finalist&lt;/strong&gt; or progress toward a CIMA qualification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-ONSITE&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU CAN EXPECT FROM US:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;: We celebrate those who think critically, like a challenge, and aspire to be trailblazers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: We give you the space and support to grow along with us and to contribute to something meaningful. We have been named Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in Technology™, Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in the Bay Area™, and certified as a Great Place to Work®!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;: We build each other up and set aside ego for the greater good.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;And because we understand the value of bringing your full and best self to work, we offer a variety of perks to manage a healthy balance, including flexible time off, wellness resources, and company-sponsored team events. Check out &lt;a href=&quot;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/&quot;&gt;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/ &lt;/a&gt;for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ACCOMMODATIONS AND ACCESSIBILITY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates with disabilities may request accommodations for all aspects of our hiring process. For more on this, contact us at &lt;a ---------- if you’re invited to an interview.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR COMMITMENT TO A STRONG AND INCLUSIVE TEAM:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re forging a future where everyone finds their rightful place and where every voice matters. Where uniqueness isn’t just accepted but embraced. That’s why we are committed to fostering the growth and development of every person, cultivating a sense of community through our Employee Resource Groups and advocating for inclusive leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everpure is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, sexual stereotypes, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or any other characteristic legally protected by the laws of the jurisdiction in which you are being considered for hire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us and bring your best.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring your bold.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pure and simple.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Finance  Staines

Director, SEO, Global Client Solutions &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3719 - Director, SEO, Global Client Solutions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About OpenMind&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;: A Leading WPP Media Brand&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;OpenMind by WPP is an integrated agency model drawing on talent from across WPP. It has been created to accelerate the European transformation for Nestlé’s media function. Core to the solution is the advanced best data and technology capabilities, fuelled by WPP’s investment in AI, to maximise the impact of Nestlé media investment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;OpenMind oversees Nestle&#39;s media activity in Zone Europe. With dozens of countries, +450 team members, and regular new product launches, the account is looking for an AI Discoverability Lead to provide strong SEO and GEO leadership for Nestle categories, supporting Nestlé&amp;nbsp;Search Leads and AI Leads. Being above-market, the role offers plenty of variety, with an enjoyable balance between driving growth for brands, strategic consultancy and laying the framework for excellence, ensuring we’re delivering change at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will spearhead efforts to ensure elevated AI Discoverability across categories. You will be a regional champion of Nestle’s success framework in this space, overseeing the implementation of the theory into both strategic and activation level layers. You will ensure universal understanding of the above at every level of our teams above-market and in-market, partnering with digital specialists, media planners and category leads. You will be a conduit point between teams which impact AI Discoverability, ensuring scopes are aligned in purpose through to effective completion. Operationally, there will be a focus on partnering with categories to ensure each has a respective plan in place which is best-in-class, utilising latest available resources efficiently in a prioritised manner, focussed on the generation of measurable end results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a unique opportunity to raise the bar for AI discoverability across ZEUR, working with some of the biggest brands on the planet eager to showcase their supremacy online. As the AI Discoverability Lead in the Above Market Zone team, you’d be leading a group of AI / GEO / Search specialists holding authority across the Zone. You will be partnering with brands to ensure they have a clear strategy in place to maximize on the visibility opportunity available, which will include working with brands at varied stages of digital maturity. A key part of this role is developing your sizeable supporting team of specialists who will be practically involved at every level, crawling sites, assessing data and developing solutions to achieve enhanced AI visibility. You will help drive the education of the wider Local Market teams on the approach to ensure the same principles ring true across the region, driving excellence further still. As such, excellent operational team management is essential to ensure all stakeholders are working in unison towards the strategic vision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build operational AI discoverability excellence across ZEUR, managing varied stakeholders to ensure the successful running of a significant total client budget across above-market and in-market teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-level GEO / SEO KPI management and market governance to effectively track performance across Zone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dominate the delivery of best in-class strategies at a zone level to maximise performance across Nestle Europe. These strategies then need to be adapted and rolled out for specific business units. It is vital we’re taking advantage of the short-term opportunities for Nestle whilst laying strong foundations for future changes in search.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the ZEUR Nestle Search and AI Leads to ensure the strategic focuses align with those of the specific business units.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective, positive management of a few direct reports and a wider team of AI, GEO and SEO specialists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build up a constructive, positive rapport with senior client contacts and third-party enablers including content agencies and development teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A confident presenter with the ability to take what can often be quite complicated concepts, distilling them down into key actions and outcomes for relevant stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commitment to progressing initiatives focused on driving share of voice and positive consumer experiences on-site.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay up to date on the latest trends in all things AI discoverability (SEO / GEO / LLM) and adapting the strategy accordingly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Knowledge &amp;amp; Abilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Impressive track record of delivering multimarket SEO strategies and charting subsequent improved business performance. We view our clients’ businesses as our own and we expect you to as well.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with businesses which are made up of multiple business units and the complexity of how those businesses overlap from a search perspective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge across all areas of GEO from technical to content and Digital PR. Depending on the market and the business units, the best opportunities will vary, as will the subsequent requirements from the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing and supporting multilayer operations across above market, clusters, and in-market. With the focus on ensuring consistent excellence and delivery of the overall strategy at all levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to demystify all things SEO / GEO / LLM to ensure clients and the wider team understand what actions are required to achieve compelling results. An ability to craft and deliver powerful stories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading and developing a talented, multi-faceted team united in a common effort to produce best in class activity as a cohesive, positive unit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to Digital more broadly, engaging with the specialism in a passionate, intellectual capacity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with a wide range of AI / SEO / GEO tools. Experience working with partners to drive enhancements to get the most from the tool suites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience using PowerPoint and delivering presentations to senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Calm under pressure and able to always think about the bigger picture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Lead Optimistically, firmly believing in and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Championing Growth and Development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to leverage the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Create an Open environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;  Please note that while our philosophy is the same across WPP, benefits may vary by office/country.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
