&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Media Solutions Account Director reports directly to the EMEA Regional Lead and serves as a pivotal figure in our London hub. You will drive EMEA campaign planning and strategy, ensuring seamless execution across the region. A critical component of this role involves leading local market strategies, with a dedicated focus on driving performance and innovation in Spain and Italy. While based in London, you will maintain a strong collaborative link with our Delhi hub to ensure execution excellence aligns with strategic intent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Airbnb is a global platform that goes beyond accommodation, offering a community where guests can book unique homes and stays, as well as participate in handcrafted experiences and services led by inspiring local hosts. As a leader on this account, you will drive the media execution that powers this diverse global ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role involves providing campaign leadership from a strategic and tactical standpoint across channels, owning best practice, and ensuring the highest standard of campaigns are delivered on time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Some of the things we’d like you to do:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strategic Leadership &amp;amp; Stakeholder Management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the EMEA Media Solutions leadership to align on regional strategy and operational standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development and oversight of local campaign strategies for key markets, specifically customising approaches for Spain and Italy to ensure local resonance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the strategic bridge between the London office and the Delhi execution hub, providing clear direction to ensure output matches client expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gain a strategic understanding of the client’s business and KPIs, proactively spotting industry trends and product opportunities to enhance activity within the EMEA region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Account Management &amp;amp; Optimisation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive account maturity by identifying areas for improvement through cross channel learning and suggesting advanced optimisation tactics for European markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee campaign agendas and create plans to eradicate root causes of errors through rigorous tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the successful running of campaigns by weaving execution into the overall cross channel strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Team Operations and Liaison&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with local market planning teams to ensure central strategies are effectively adapted and aligned with local market nuances.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategise and implement automation to increase efficiency across EMEA workstreams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Delhi hub team to bridge skill gaps and ensure they have the strategic context required for execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure optimum utilisation of resources by guiding the extended team on hygiene tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive in platform experience with one or more of the following: Meta, TikTok, DV360 (or other DSP), Google Ads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven Project Management and Leadership experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of the EMEA media landscape, with specific experience managing campaigns in Spain and Italy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of media planning fundamentals e.g. reach, frequency, channels, formats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regularly contributes to platform best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Required Education and Experience:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in media activation at Account Manager level or above, delivering excellence across brand and performance campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel, hospitality, or similar market experience is desired, and experience working within a global client is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with running campaigns across multiple countries / languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with large brands in a complex structure within an agency environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of managing vendor relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
