Principal System Architect, Spectrum (m/f/d) &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission Brief&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your Role in Our Space Mission:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW176097795 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW176097795 BCX0&quot;&gt;As Principal System Architect for Reusability, you will&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW176097795 BCX0&quot;&gt;lead&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW176097795 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;exploration of the reusable-launcher design space and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW176097795 BCX0&quot;&gt;drive convergence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW176097795 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;towards a coherent vehicle architecture&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW176097795 BCX0&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW176097795 BCX0&quot;&gt;Using models and analyses developed by specialist teams, you will identify the most valuable design paths, direct further investigation and make architecture decisions that balance performance, development risk, operability, lifecycle cost and profitability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW176097795 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualification Checklist&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Extensive launch-vehicle architecture experience, including direct work on rocket development programs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Demonstrated experience with reusable launch vehicles, recovery architectures or reuse-driven vehicle design.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
